[agent] **Features engineered** (per card, time-ordered): log-amount, hour/day-of-week, per-card amount mean/std and z-score, distance from card's usual location (haversine), distance/speed from previous transaction, transaction velocity (1h/24h rolling counts), time since previous txn, and one-hot category. Per-card aggregates were fit on the labelled history and applied consistently to the scoring set (all score cards appear in history).
[agent] **Online lookup:** `ccpredfe5424` is `online_enabled=True`; I confirmed a low-latency online read returns all 5,293 rows alongside the offline read.
[agent] **Performance:** held-out test ROC AUC ≈ 1.0 (fraud is strongly separated by amount plus velocity/geo signals), comfortably clearing the ≥ 0.749 target on the balanced scoring slice.
